@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### 1. Liveness Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
Accept: text/plain

### 2. Create Order (Two Items)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "0199b0b1-7040-7890-8abc-0123456789ab",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPriceAmount": 10.125,
      "currency": "GBP"
    },
    {
      "productId": "0199b0b1-7040-7890-8abc-0123456789ac",
      "quantity": 3,
      "unitPriceAmount": 0.625,
      "currency": "GBP"
    }
  ]
}

### 3. Get Order By ID (replace with the orderId returned by POST)
@orderId = 0199b0b1-7040-7890-8abc-0123456789ad
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json
